+
+# Give each task a unique id
+
+The app needs a stable way to refer to a task that survives renaming.
+
+- `add` returns a task with an `id`: a string no other task of the list has. Ids are made from a
+  per-list counter (no clock, no randomness, per the domain rules).
+- `TaskList.get(id)` returns the task with that id, as a `Result`.
+- `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept a title or an id.
